From: Aspartame GTK4 migration
Subject: [PATCH] gtk4: prefer modern bundle over duplicate GTK3 entry

The GTK4 Help bundle intentionally keeps Sugar's canonical bundle_id, but the
same ID is installed system-wide with a GTK3 exec. Registry scan order can
therefore select the wrong runtime. In the isolated modern Space, prefer the
GTK4 exec when replacing a same-version duplicate.

--- a/src/jarabe/model/bundleregistry.py
+++ b/src/jarabe/model/bundleregistry.py
@@ -307,2 +307,12 @@
         installed = self.get_bundle(bundle_id)
+        if (installed is not None and
+                os.environ.get('ASPARTAME_GTK4_PREVIEW') == '1'):
+            installed_exec = installed.get_command()
+            bundle_exec = bundle.get_command()
+            if ('sugar-activity3' in installed_exec and
+                    'sugar-activity4' in bundle_exec):
+                logging.info('Prefer GTK4 bundle %s over GTK3 duplicate',
+                             bundle_id)
+                self.remove_bundle(installed.get_path(), emit_signals=False)
+                installed = None
 
         if installed is not None:
